abstract: "Case-level documentary evidence and executable calculations for 33 operational AI-assisted university-admissions pathways. Includes primary and record-linked states, dated source/population checks and correction ledgers. Python code is MIT-licensed; original data and documentation are CC BY 4.0, excluding third-party excerpts as detailed in RIGHTS_NOTICE.md. End-to-end replication of the historical discovery process is not claimed. This deposit does not imply journal acceptance."
